"Did you know that you can automatically register your customers as "
"affiliates? This is a great way to get more affiliates on your site. You can "
"enable this functionality in the <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">addons "
"menu</a>."
msgstr ""
"Wist u dat u uw klanten automatisch kunt registreren als affiliates? Dit is "
"een geweldige manier om meer affiliates op uw site te krijgen. U kunt deze "
"functionaliteit inschakelen in het <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\">menu "
"addons</a>."

#: app/Lib/AdminDashboardV2Helper.php:124
