#: app/Lib/CustomAffiliateSlugs/AffiliateCustomSlugBase.php:486
msgid ""
"The custom slug is empty. Custom slugs must have at least one character."
msgstr ""
"De aangepaste slug is leeg. Aangepaste slugs moeten minstens één karakter "
"hebben."

#: app/Lib/CustomAffiliateSlugs/AffiliateCustomSlugBase.php:491
msgid "The custom slug is too long. Custom slugs cannot exceed 40 characters."
msgstr ""
"De aangepaste slug is te lang. Aangepaste slugs mogen niet langer zijn dan "
"40 tekens."

#: app/Lib/CustomAffiliateSlugs/AffiliateCustomSlugBase.php:496
msgid "The custom slug cannot contain only numbers."
msgstr "De aangepaste slug kan niet alleen getallen bevatten."

#: app/Lib/CustomAffiliateSlugs/AffiliateCustomSlugBase.php:501
msgid ""
"The custom slug cannot contain any character that is not an English numeric "
"digit or alphabetic letter."
msgstr ""
"De aangepaste slug mag geen enkel teken bevatten dat geen Engels cijfer of "
"alfabetische letter is."

#: app/Lib/CustomAffiliateSlugs/AffiliateCustomSlugBase.php:506
msgid ""
"The custom slug already exists. Custom slugs must be unique across an "
"affiliate program."
msgstr ""
"De aangepaste slug bestaat al. Aangepaste slugs moeten uniek zijn binnen een "
"affiliate-programma."

#: app/Lib/CustomAffiliateSlugs/AffiliateCustomSlugBase.php:511
msgid ""
"The Affiliate has reached or exceeded the limit of custom slugs they can "
"own. This limit is set by the site admin."
msgstr ""
"De Affiliate heeft de limiet bereikt of overschreden van het aantal "
"aangepaste slugs dat hij kan bezitten. Deze limiet wordt ingesteld door de "
"sitebeheerder."

#: app/Lib/CustomAffiliateSlugs/CustomSlugControllerFunctions.php:55
