#: app/Lib/Settings.php:1022
msgid "MailChimp Integration - Enable Affiliate Sync"
msgstr "MailChimp Integratie - Affiliate Sync inschakelen"

#: app/Lib/Settings.php:1027
msgid ""
"When enabled, Solid Affiliate will sync new affiliate registrations as "
"contacts in your MailChimp account. All contacts will be given an "
"<code>affiliate</code> tag within MailChimp for easy segmentation."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer Solid Affiliate is ingeschakeld, worden nieuwe affiliate-"
"registraties gesynchroniseerd als contactpersonen in uw MailChimp-account. "
"Alle contacten krijgen een <code>affiliate</code> tag binnen MailChimp voor "
"eenvoudige segmentatie."

#: app/Lib/Settings.php:1034
msgid "Affiliate Sync - List ID"
msgstr "Affiliate Sync - Lijst ID"

#: app/Lib/Settings.php:1039
msgid ""
"You can set a specific audience list within your MailChimp account by "
"entering the ID. Solid Affiliate will sync newly registered Affiliates to "
"this list. Leave it blank to sync to your default list. See <a "
"href=\"https://mailchimp.com/help/find-audience-id/\">finding your MailChimp "
"audience ID.</a>"
msgstr ""
"U kunt een specifieke doelgroeplijst binnen uw MailChimp-account instellen "
"door de ID in te voeren. Solid Affiliate zal nieuw geregistreerde Affiliates "
"met deze lijst synchroniseren. Laat het leeg om te synchroniseren met uw "
"standaard lijst. Zie <a href=\"https://mailchimp.com/help/find-audience-id/"
"\">het vinden van uw MailChimp doelgroep ID.</a>"

